Package: dahlia-dashboard
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Dahlia Linux <https://github.com/Fabiy99/dahlia-linux>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-fastapi, python3-uvicorn, nginx, adduser, systemd, dahlia-agent (= @VERSION@)
Description: Dahlia Linux web dashboard
 Web UI on https://<server>/ for disks, jobs, updates and the system.
 The backend runs as the unprivileged user dahlia-ui on 127.0.0.1:8080
 behind nginx and reaches root actions only through dahlia-agent. The
 first visit opens a setup wizard protected by a one-time code shown on
 the console.
